{
  "info": {
    "name": "Task Tracker API",
    "description": "REST API untuk manajemen task — Technical Test PT. Tirtamas Coldstorindo Logistik.\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:8080`\n\n## Cara Pakai\n1. Pastikan server sudah berjalan (`go run main.go` atau `docker compose up`)\n2. Gunakan variabel `{{base_url}}` yang sudah di-set ke `http://localhost:8080`\n3. Jalankan request sesuai urutan di folder untuk flow lengkap\n\n## Status Task\n- `pending` — belum selesai (default saat dibuat)\n- `done` — sudah selesai",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "task-tracker-api-collection"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL server. Ganti jika server berjalan di port/host berbeda."
    },
    {
      "key": "task_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID task yang digunakan untuk request GetByID, UpdateStatus, Delete. Di-set otomatis oleh request Create Task."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Mengecek apakah server berjalan normal. Digunakan untuk liveness/readiness probe pada container orchestration."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Server running",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Status is ok', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tasks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil seluruh task yang tersimpan, diurutkan berdasarkan `created_at` descending (terbaru di atas).\n\n**Response:**\n- `data` — array of task\n- `count` — jumlah total task"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — List of tasks",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"count\": 3,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"title\": \"Write unit tests\",\n      \"description\": \"Cover all handler and repository functions.\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2024-01-03T10:00:00Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2024-01-03T10:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Empty list",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"count\": 0,\n  \"data\": []\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has data and count', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('count');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.count).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Count matches data length', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.count).to.eql(json.data.length);",
                  "});",
                  "// Simpan task_id pertama untuk dipakai request lain",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', json.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil satu task berdasarkan UUID.\n\n**Path Parameter:**\n- `id` — UUID task\n\n**Response:**\n- `200` — task ditemukan\n- `404` — task tidak ditemukan\n\n> Jalankan **Get All Tasks** terlebih dahulu agar `task_id` ter-set otomatis, atau isi manual di Collection Variables."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Task found",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"title\": \"Write unit tests\",\n    \"description\": \"Cover all handler and repository functions.\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2024-01-03T10:00:00Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2024-01-03T10:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"task not found\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has data with correct fields', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('title');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('status');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buat Flutter App\",\n  \"description\": \"Implementasi Task Tracker menggunakan Flutter dengan Riverpod state management.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Membuat task baru. Status default otomatis `pending`.\n\n**Request Body:**\n| Field | Type | Wajib | Validasi |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `title` | string | ✅ | 1–100 karakter |\n| `description` | string | ✅ | 1–500 karakter |\n\n**Response:**\n- `201` — task berhasil dibuat\n- `400` — validasi gagal (title/description kosong atau melebihi batas karakter)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"new-uuid-1234-5678-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"title\": \"Buat Flutter App\",\n    \"description\": \"Implementasi Task Tracker menggunakan Flutter dengan Riverpod state management.\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2024-01-04T09:00:00Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2024-01-04T09:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request — Missing title",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Key: 'CreateTaskRequest.Title' Error:Field validation for 'Title' failed on the 'required' tag\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request — Missing description",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Key: 'CreateTaskRequest.Description' Error:Field validation for 'Description' failed on the 'required' tag\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has task data', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('pending');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "// Simpan task_id dari task yang baru dibuat",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', json.data.id);",
                  "    console.log('task_id set to:', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
